                <pb facs="0761" n="671" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav02/pg671"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/1167</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Odessa</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Ray</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Odessa</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-02-21T11:00:00+02:02"><hi rendition="#italic">February 21,
                                1918, 11 a.m.</hi></date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received February 27, 9.51
                        p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>After three days’ battle between the Little Russians and Maximalists aided by the
                    fleet which bombarded the city Odessa remains under the control of the
                    Maximalists. The Americans are uninjured.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ray</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
